to":"宣成侯","people_xingming":"霍光","start_index":105,"tongjian_id":"90be46a9-db0e-11ef-8252-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"三河","place_name_jianti_auto":"三河","place_note":"涇、渭、洛河","resolved_place_entity_id":1982,"start_index":110,"tongjian_id":"90be46aa-db0e-11ef-ae83-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"容斋随笔/东不可名园","excerpts":[{"context_after":"’服虔曰：‘东园处此器，以镜置其中，以悬尸上。’师古曰：...","context_before":"...东园主章”为箴，予曰：“君但知《汉表》耳！《霍光传》：‘","source_end_index":181,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"4d8a5154-d502-4ce0-ac08-8ef3763fdd59","source_start_index":171,"source_text":"光之丧，赐东园温明。"}],"path":"五笔/卷九/东不可名园","source_name":"容斋随笔"}],"class_tags":["人事","内政"],"content":"1春，霍光病篤。車駕自臨問，上爲之涕泣。光上書謝恩，願分國邑三千戶以封兄孫奉車都尉山爲列侯，奉兄去病祀。卽日，拜光子禹爲右將軍。三月，庚午，光薨。上及皇太后親臨光喪，中二千石治冢，賜梓宮、葬具皆如乘輿制度，諡曰宣成侯。發三河卒穿復土，置園邑三百家，長、丞奉守；下詔復其後世，疇其爵邑，世世無有所與。","content_fanyi":"春季，霍光病势沉重。汉宣帝亲自登门探问，并为他流泪。霍光上书谢恩，表示愿从自己的封邑中分出三千户，用来封兄长霍去病的孙子、奉车都尉霍山为列侯，以承奉霍去病的祭祀。当天，任命霍光的儿子霍禹为右将军。三月庚午日，霍光去世。汉宣帝和皇太后亲自到霍光灵前吊丧，命中二千石官员负责修治坟墓，所赐棺木、葬具都依照皇帝车舆的制度，谥号为宣成侯。又征发三河一带的士兵挖掘墓穴、回填封土，设置三百家园邑，以其赋税供奉墓园，由长、丞守护祭祀；下诏免除霍光后代的赋税徭役，使爵位封邑世代承袭，世世代代不再承担赋役。","content_jianti_auto":"1春，霍光病笃。车驾自临问，上为之涕泣。光上书谢恩，愿分国邑三千户以封兄孙奉车都尉山为列侯，奉兄去病祀。即日，拜光子禹为右将军。三月，庚午，光薨。上及皇太后亲临光丧，中二千石治冢，赐梓宫、葬具皆如乘舆制度，谥曰宣成侯。发三河卒穿复土，置园邑三百家，长、丞奉守；下诏复其后世，畴其爵邑，世世无有所与。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[{"excerpts":[{"context_after":"，则光之废主，乃以邀功而贸赏，又何怪其妻之鸩后而子之谋逆...","context_before":"...赏贸而得之者也。光不引咎以谢严延年之责，晏然受之而不辞，","source_end_index":250,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"fea1fc95-3045-4c0f-b96c-305655b314f8","source_start_index":239,"source_text":"他日且为霍山请五等之荣"}],"title":"一 非淡泊无以明志"}],"id":1995,"number":1,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"90be4696-db0e-11ef-9a77-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[{"decision_name":"提议填补大将军空缺的人选","decision_tongjian_id":"DECISION_90BE46ABDB0E11EFA752A0D3651F611F_01"}],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"言事而不欲宣泄，重封上之，故曰封事。漢官曰：凡章表皆啓封；其言密事，得用皁囊。","note_content_jianti_auto":"言事而不欲宣泄，重封上之，故曰封事。汉官曰：凡章表皆启封；其言密事，得用皂囊。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"90be46ac-db0e-11ef-ac25-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"塡，古鎭字通。","note_content_jianti_auto":"塡，古镇字通。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":30,"tongjian_id":"90be46ae-db0e-11ef-a3ea-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"90be46b0-db0e-11ef-aeac-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"師古曰：大臣位空，則起爭奪之權也。塞，悉則翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"师古曰：大臣位空，则起争夺之权也。塞，悉则翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":40,"tongjian_id":"90be46af-db0e-11ef-abcf-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"張安世","people_name_jianti_auto":"张安世","start_index":20,"tongjian_id":"90be46b2-db0e-11ef-9fdc-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"霍禹","people_name_jianti_auto":"霍禹","start_index":40,"tongjian_id":"90be46b3-db0e-11ef-90d6-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"禹","people_name_jianti_auto":"禹","start_index":53,"tongjian_id":"90be46b4-db0e-11ef-b073-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"荀","people_name_jianti_auto":"荀","start_index":58,"tongjian_id":"90be46b5-db0e-11ef-9179-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"安世","people_name_jianti_auto":"安世","start_index":71,"tongjian_id":"90be46b6-db0e-11ef-b66e-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"安世","people_name_jianti_auto":"安世","start_index":116,"tongjian_id":"90be46b7-db0e-11ef-97b4-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"禹","people_name_jianti_auto":"禹","start_index":137,"tongjian_id":"90be46b8-db0e-11ef-9f70-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"考異曰：百官表：「地節三年，四月，戊申，張安世爲大司馬。七月，戊戌，更爲衞將軍；霍禹爲大司馬。七月，壬辰，禹要斬。」荀紀：「三年，四月，戊辰，安世爲大司馬。」按明年四月無戊辰，七月無戊戌，又不當再言七月。以宣紀、張安世、霍光傳考之，安世爲司馬當在今年，爲衞將軍當在明年十月，禹死在四年七月，蓋年表旁行通連書之，致此誤也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"考异曰：百官表：「地节三年，四月，戊申，张安世为大司马。七月，戊戌，更为衞将军；霍禹为大司马。七月，壬辰，禹要斩。」荀纪：「三年，四月，戊辰，安世为大司马。」按明年四月无戊辰，七月无戊戌，又不当再言七月。以宣纪、张安世、霍光传考之，安世为司马当在今年，为衞将军当在明年十月，禹死在四年七月，盖年表旁行通连书之，致此误也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":104,"tongjian_id":"90be46b1-db0e-11ef-9e7f-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.95,"official_category":"监察","official_name":"御史大夫","official_note":"御史大夫是秦汉时期的高级官职，负责监察百官和司法事务，此处魏相以御史大夫身份上奏建议。","official_rank":"正三品","source_snippet":"御史大夫魏相上封事曰","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"91cbc590-1bd6-40d8-b230-20529ab63276"},{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"军事指挥","official_name":"大將軍","official_note":"大将军是汉代最高军事长官，此处指国家刚失去大将军（可能指霍光去世），建议任命新的大将军。","official_rank":"正一品","source_snippet":"國家新失大將軍","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"e284981f-ec45-4807-b4fd-cd579b3a2b49"},{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"军事指挥","official_name":"車騎將軍","official_note":"车骑将军是汉代高级军事官职，此处建议任命安世（张安世）从车骑将军升为大将军。","official_rank":"正二品","source_snippet":"宜以車騎將軍安世爲大將軍","start_index":32,"tongjian_id":"a9f64bb7-4a1d-40c8-b048-c4cfcb1857e8"},{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"中枢机构","official_name":"光祿勳","official_note":"光禄勋是汉代九卿之一，负责宫廷宿卫和礼仪，此处建议安世不再兼任光禄勋职务。","official_rank":"正三品","source_snippet":"毋令領光祿勳事","start_index":44,"tongjian_id":"53b4a86c-42b0-4040-8a77-ea041f1fa221"},{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"中枢机构","official_name":"光祿勳","official_note":"光禄勋是汉代九卿之一，此处建议任命延寿（张延寿）为光禄勋，接替其父职务。","official_rank":"正三品","source_snippet":"以其子延壽爲光祿勳","start_index":52,"tongjian_id":"f0c6a4d5-6f44-4355-aab0-cdc298891107"},{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"军事指挥","official_name":"大司馬","official_note":"大司马是汉代最高军事官职之一，常与大将军并置，此处任命安世为大司马兼车骑将军。","official_rank":"正一品","source_snippet":"以安世爲大司馬、車騎將軍","start_index":78,"tongjian_id":"88f9914b-3e3f-404d-bf8e-64ab67374e22"},{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"军事指挥","official_name":"車騎將軍","official_note":"车骑将军是汉代高级军事官职，此处安世被任命为大司马兼车骑将军，显示其军事权力。","official_rank":"正二品","source_snippet":"以安世爲大司馬、車騎將軍","start_index":84,"tongjian_id":"0bfde2d2-a406-4f7b-815d-07be1d540e01"},{"confidence":0.85,"official_category":"中枢机构","official_name":"尚書事","official_note":"领尚书事指兼任尚书台事务，是汉代中枢权力职位，此处安世被任命兼领尚书事，以加强中央控制。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"領尚書事","start_index":94,"tongjian_id":"7f11e448-06b3-4de4-8f14-583ff417a5de"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_death_year":-59,"link_td_description":"魏相，字弱翁，出身济阴郡定陶，后迁居平陵，西汉政治家。","link_td_id":"Q10006239","link_td_number_id":519200,"people_name":"魏相","people_name_jianti_auto":"魏相","people_xingming":"魏相","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"90be46bf-db0e-11ef-9be8-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":-62,"link_td_description":"张安世，西汉杜陵县（今陕西省西安市东南）人，为汉武帝至汉宣帝时代的三朝重臣。","link_td_id":"Q10004229","link_td_number_id":243494,"people_name":"安世","people_name_jianti_auto":"安世","people_xingming":"张安世","start_index":46,"tongjian_id":"90c069d0-db0e-11ef-b2ee-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":-51,"link_td_description":"张延寿，京兆杜陵县（今陕西省西安市东南）人，西汉政治人物。御史大夫张汤之孙，张安世的次子。","link_td_id":"Q10019839","link_td_number_id":6034433,"people_name":"延壽","people_name_jianti_auto":"延寿","people_xingming":"张延寿","start_index":64,"tongjian_id":"90c069d1-db0e-11ef-ab78-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":-62,"link_td_description":"张安世，西汉杜陵县（今陕西省西安市东南）人，为汉武帝至汉宣帝时代的三朝重臣。","link_td_id":"Q10004229","link_td_number_id":243494,"people_name":"安世","people_name_jianti_auto":"安世","people_xingming":"张安世","start_index":87,"tongjian_id":"90c069d2-db0e-11ef-9237-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["人事","权争"],"content":"御史大夫魏相上封事曰：「國家新失大將軍，宜顯明功臣以塡藩國，毋空大位，以塞爭權。宜以車騎將軍安世爲大將軍，毋令領光祿勳事；以其子延壽爲光祿勳。」上亦欲用之。夏，四月，戊申，以安世爲大司馬、車騎將軍，領尚書事。","content_fanyi":"御史大夫魏相呈上密封奏章说：“国家刚刚失去大将军，应当褒扬功臣以安定藩国，不可让大将军之位空悬，以免引起争权。应任命车骑将军张安世为大将军，不再让他兼管光禄勋事务；任命他的儿子张延寿为光禄勋。”汉宣帝也有意任用张安世。夏季，四月戊申日，汉宣帝任命张安世为大司马、车骑将军，掌领尚书事务。","content_jianti_auto":"御史大夫魏相上封事曰：「国家新失大将军，宜显明功臣以塡藩国，毋空大位，以塞争权。宜以车骑将军安世为大将军，毋令领光禄勋事；以其子延寿为光禄勋。」上亦欲用之。夏，四月，戊申，以安世为大司马、车骑将军，领尚书事。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":1996,"reading_annotation_sources":[{"count":1,"source":"资治通鉴考异","source_key":"资治通鉴考异"}],"start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"90be46ab-db0e-11ef-a752-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"魯","place_name_jianti_auto":"鲁","place_note":"山东曲阜","resolved_place_entity_id":506,"start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"90c069d4-db0e-11ef-93cd-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["内政"],"content":"2鳳皇集魯，羣鳥從之。大赦天下。","content_fanyi":"凤凰在鲁国聚集，成群的飞鸟跟随其后。大赦天下。","content_jianti_auto":"2凤皇集鲁，群鸟从之。大赦天下。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":1997,"number":2,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"90c069d3-db0e-11ef-9576-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"尹氏","people_name_jianti_auto":"尹氏","start_index":16,"tongjian_id":"90c069d7-db0e-11ef-83f5-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"尹氏","people_name_jianti_auto":"尹氏","start_index":20,"tongjian_id":"90c069d8-db0e-11ef-89b6-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"尹氏","people_name_jianti_auto":"尹氏","start_index":34,"tongjian_id":"90c069d9-db0e-11ef-9b1a-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"公羊傳：隱三年，夏，四月，辛卯，尹氏卒。尹氏者何？天子之大夫也。其稱尹氏何？貶。曷爲貶？譏世卿。世卿，非禮也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"公羊传：隐三年，夏，四月，辛卯，尹氏卒。尹氏者何？天子之大夫也。其称尹氏何？贬。曷为贬？讥世卿。世卿，非礼也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":52,"tongjian_id":"90c069d6-db0e-11ef-9dee-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"90c069dc-db0e-11ef-878f-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"襄公","people_name_jianti_auto":"襄公","start_index":26,"tongjian_id":"90c069dd-db0e-11ef-8bbf-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"成公","people_name_jianti_auto":"成公","start_index":29,"tongjian_id":"90c069de-db0e-11ef-89f8-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"昭公","people_name_jianti_auto":"昭公","start_index":32,"tongjian_id":"90c069df-db0e-11ef-a9df-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"宋","place_name_jianti_auto":"宋","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"90c069e0-db0e-11ef-ba32-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"公羊傳曰：宋三世無大夫，三世內取也。師古曰：三世，謂襄公、成公、昭公也，內取於國之大夫也。「爲」，恐當作「無」。惡，烏路翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"公羊传曰：宋三世无大夫，三世内取也。师古曰：三世，谓襄公、成公、昭公也，内取于国之大夫也。「为」，恐当作「无」。恶，乌路翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":59,"tongjian_id":"90c069db-db0e-11ef-88c5-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"季友","people_name_jianti_auto":"季友","start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"90c069e3-db0e-11ef-a0e5-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"僖公","people_name_jianti_auto":"僖公","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"90c069e4-db0e-11ef-8283-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"行父","people_name_jianti_auto":"行父","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"90c069e5-db0e-11ef-b30a-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"東門氏","people_name_jianti_auto":"东门氏","start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"90c069e6-db0e-11ef-a5fa-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"意如","people_name_jianti_auto":"意如","start_index":15,"tongjian_id":"90c069e7-db0e-11ef-a168-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"昭公","people_name_jianti_auto":"昭公","start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"90c069e8-db0e-11ef-80be-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"哀公","people_name_jianti_auto":"哀公","start_index":27,"tongjian_id":"90c069e9-db0e-11ef-ad40-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"季氏","people_name_jianti_auto":"季氏","start_index":31,"tongjian_id":"90c069ea-db0e-11ef-951c-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"魯","place_name_jianti_auto":"鲁","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"90c069eb-db0e-11ef-8ddc-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"魯國","place_name_jianti_auto":"鲁国","start_index":23,"tongjian_id":"90c069ec-db0e-11ef-8d46-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"邾","place_name_jianti_auto":"邾","start_index":43,"tongjian_id":"90c069ed-db0e-11ef-a77e-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"魯自季友立僖公，行父逐東門氏，意如逐昭公，世專魯國。至哀公，惡季氏之偪而不能去，遂孫于邾。","note_content_jianti_auto":"鲁自季友立僖公，行父逐东门氏，意如逐昭公，世专鲁国。至哀公，恶季氏之偪而不能去，遂孙于邾。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":67,"tongjian_id":"90c069e2-db0e-11ef-89f2-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"賢","people_name_jianti_auto":"贤","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"90c069ef-db0e-11ef-b573-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"謂領尚書事也。賢曰：樞機，近要之官也。春秋運斗樞曰：北斗，第一天樞，第二璇，第三機也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"谓领尚书事也。贤曰：枢机，近要之官也。春秋运斗枢曰：北斗，第一天枢，第二璇，第三机也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":106,"tongjian_id":"90c069ee-db0e-11ef-b94f-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"90c069f2-db0e-11ef-99c0-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"應劭","people_name_jianti_auto":"应劭","start_index":22,"tongjian_id":"90c069f3-db0e-11ef-aca0-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"師古曰：通籍，謂禁門之中皆有名籍，恣出入也。應劭曰：籍者，爲二尺竹牒，設其年紀、名字、物色，懸之宮門，按省相應，乃得入也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"师古曰：通籍，谓禁门之中皆有名籍，恣出入也。应劭曰：籍者，为二尺竹牒，设其年纪、名字、物色，悬之宫门，按省相应，乃得入也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":133,"tongjian_id":"90c069f1-db0e-11ef-950b-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"90c069f5-db0e-11ef-b83a-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"師古曰：寖，漸也。不制，不可制御也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"师古曰：寖，渐也。不制，不可制御也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":150,"tongjian_id":"90c069f4-db0e-11ef-a878-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"魏相","people_name_jianti_auto":"魏相","start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"90c069f8-db0e-11ef-af1a-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"汉","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"90c069f9-db0e-11ef-8580-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"漢三公，九卿皆外朝，今魏相給事中，則得入禁中，預中朝之議。","note_content_jianti_auto":"汉三公，九卿皆外朝，今魏相给事中，则得入禁中，预中朝之议。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":246,"tongjian_id":"90c069f7-db0e-11ef-bfef-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.95,"official_category":"軍事指揮","official_name":"奉車都尉","official_note":"奉車都尉是漢代官職，掌管皇帝車駕，屬近侍武官。在《資治通鑑》此段中，霍光兄孫霍山被任命為奉車都尉並領尚書事，顯示霍氏家族在霍光死後仍掌握重要職位，涉及軍事與行政權力。","official_rank":"比二千石","source_snippet":"使以奉車都尉領尚書事","start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"971849f3-3672-4e0b-a699-c2e989434fb6"},{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"中樞機構","official_name":"尚書事","official_note":"尚書事指掌管尚書臺事務，是漢代中樞重要職務，負責文書處理和政令傳達。此處霍山領尚書事，反映霍氏家族控制朝廷機要，與魏相奏言中「政由冢宰」相呼應，凸顯權力集中問題。","official_rank":"高級","source_snippet":"使以奉車都尉領尚書事","start_index":24,"tongjian_id":"da1dc18a-2033-491a-860d-bb5cde459342"},{"confidence":0.95,"official_category":"軍事指揮","official_name":"右將軍","official_note":"右將軍是漢代高級武職，負責軍事指揮。此處指霍光之子霍禹擔任右將軍，顯示霍氏家族在軍中勢力，魏相以此為例說明霍家權勢過大，可能威脅國家穩定。","official_rank":"高級將領","source_snippet":"子復爲右將軍","start_index":88,"tongjian_id":"12b629c8-c831-408a-8c03-41310ea4e981"},{"confidence":0.85,"official_category":"中樞機構","official_name":"領尚書者","official_note":"領尚書者指負責尚書事務的官員，此處在敘述上書制度時提及，原由霍山等霍氏成員擔任，可先審閱奏章副封，易造成壅蔽。魏相建議去除副封以防此弊，旨在削弱霍家對朝政的控制。","official_rank":"高級","source_snippet":"領尚書者先發副封","start_index":184,"tongjian_id":"6f5812e9-671e-400a-8e60-f48dd19065c4"},{"confidence":0.95,"official_category":"中樞近臣","official_name":"給事中","official_note":"給事中是漢代加官，可出入宮禁，參與議政。此處皇帝任命魏相為給事中，以示採納其建議並賦予其近臣職位，協助改革上書制度以加強皇權，對抗霍氏專權。","official_rank":"比二千石","source_snippet":"詔相給事中","start_index":226,"tongjian_id":"b391da45-920f-41da-a315-b4b89ac21d13"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_death_year":-68,"link_td_description":"霍光，字子孟，西汉河东郡平阳县（今山西省临汾市）人，政治家，麒麟阁十一功臣之首，名将霍去病异母弟，昭帝上官皇后外祖父，宣帝霍皇后之父。","link_td_id":"Q10006237","link_td_number_id":81818,"people_name":"光","people_name_jianti_auto":"光","people_xingming":"霍光","start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"90c069fa-db0e-11ef-8e12-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"