tart_index":119,"tongjian_id":"90c06a05-db0e-11ef-88d0-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":-66,"link_td_description":"显，中国西汉时期大司马霍光的妻子，霍成君生母，姓氏不详。显曾毒死汉宣帝皇后许平君，以求自己的女儿霍成君成为皇后。","link_td_id":"Q10004787","link_td_number_id":5652885,"people_name":"顯","people_name_jianti_auto":"显","people_xingming":"显","start_index":122,"tongjian_id":"90c06a06-db0e-11ef-8b0c-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":-59,"link_td_description":"魏相，字弱翁，出身济阴郡定陶，后迁居平陵，西汉政治家。","link_td_id":"Q10006239","link_td_number_id":519200,"people_name":"相","people_name_jianti_auto":"相","people_xingming":"魏相","start_index":217,"tongjian_id":"90c06a08-db0e-11ef-be73-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":-117,"link_death_year":-61,"link_td_description":"许广汉，昌邑（今山东省金乡县）人，西汉宦官，平恩侯，汉宣帝皇后许平君之父。","link_td_id":"Q10004577","link_td_number_id":1274030,"people_name":"許伯","people_name_jianti_auto":"许伯","people_xingming":"许广汉","start_index":220,"tongjian_id":"90c06a09-db0e-11ef-afc5-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":-59,"link_td_description":"魏相，字弱翁，出身济阴郡定陶，后迁居平陵，西汉政治家。","link_td_id":"Q10006239","link_td_number_id":519200,"people_name":"相","people_name_jianti_auto":"相","people_xingming":"魏相","start_index":236,"tongjian_id":"90c06a0a-db0e-11ef-a7b7-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"宋","place_name_jianti_auto":"宋","resolved_place_entity_id":354,"start_index":53,"tongjian_id":"90c06a01-db0e-11ef-a723-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"魯","place_name_jianti_auto":"鲁","resolved_place_entity_id":506,"start_index":60,"tongjian_id":"90c06a03-db0e-11ef-b7f4-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"長信宮","place_name_jianti_auto":"长信宫","resolved_place_entity_id":1961,"start_index":129,"tongjian_id":"90c06a07-db0e-11ef-8c94-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["内政","权争"],"content":"3上思報大將軍德，乃封光兄孫山爲樂平侯，使以奉車都尉領尚書事。魏相因昌成君許廣漢奏封事，言「春秋譏世卿，惡宋三世爲大夫及魯季孫之專權，皆危亂國家。自後元以來，祿去王室，政由冢宰。今光死，子復爲右將軍，兄子秉樞機，昆弟、諸壻據權勢，在兵官，光夫人顯及諸女皆通籍長信宮，或夜詔門出入，驕奢放縱，恐寖不制，宜有以損奪其權，破散陰謀，以固萬世之基，全功臣之世。」又故事：諸上書者皆爲二封，署其一曰「副」，領尚書者先發副封，所言不善，屛去不奏。相復因許伯白去副封以防壅蔽。帝善之，詔相給事中，皆從其議。","content_fanyi":"汉宣帝感念大将军霍光的恩德，于是封霍光哥哥霍去病的孙子霍山为乐平侯，让他以奉车都尉的身份掌领尚书事务。魏相通过昌成君许广汉呈上密封奏章，说道：“《春秋》讥讽世袭卿位，憎恶宋国连续三代担任大夫以及鲁国季孙氏专权，这些都是危害扰乱国家的。自从后元年间以来，权柄离开皇室，政令由宰辅决定。如今霍光已死，他的儿子又担任右将军，他的侄子执掌中枢机要，兄弟、女婿们占据权势、掌领兵职，霍光的夫人显和几个女儿都在长信宫有出入门籍，有时夜间奉诏出入宫门，骄横奢侈、放纵无度，恐怕会逐渐难以控制，应当设法减削他们的权力，粉碎他们的密谋，以巩固万世基业，并保全功臣的后代。”另外，按照旧例：凡上书的人都要准备两份，其中一份标明为“副本”，掌领尚书事务的人先拆看副本，如果所言不善，就搁置不上奏。魏相又通过许广汉请求去掉副本，以防言路阻塞、皇上受蒙蔽。宣帝认为很好，下诏任命魏相为给事中，全部采纳了他的建议。","content_jianti_auto":"3上思报大将军德，乃封光兄孙山为乐平侯，使以奉车都尉领尚书事。魏相因昌成君许广汉奏封事，言「春秋讥世卿，恶宋三世为大夫及鲁季孙之专权，皆危乱国家。自后元以来，禄去王室，政由冢宰。今光死，子复为右将军，兄子秉枢机，昆弟、诸壻据权势，在兵官，光夫人显及诸女皆通籍长信宫，或夜诏门出入，骄奢放纵，恐寖不制，宜有以损夺其权，破散阴谋，以固万世之基，全功臣之世。」又故事：诸上书者皆为二封，署其一曰「副」，领尚书者先发副封，所言不善，屛去不奏。相复因许伯白去副封以防壅蔽。帝善之，诏相给事中，皆从其议。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[{"excerpts":[{"context_after":"，光亦惩昌邑之失而正少主之视听，特未深知宣帝之明而持之太...","context_before":"...共废立者而不阿，悍妻行弑，欲自举发，特荏苒而不能自胜耳。","source_end_index":99,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"46cf5c6f-910b-4a06-b42d-224ba021aad6","source_start_index":84,"source_text":"上书者以副封先达领尚书者而后奏"}],"title":"三 君子谨始进"}],"id":1998,"number":3,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"90c069d5-db0e-11ef-8e17-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"90c06a0d-db0e-11ef-a630-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"師古曰：閭，里門也。閻，里中門也。言從里巷而卽天位也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"师古曰：闾，里门也。阎，里中门也。言从里巷而即天位也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"90c06a0c-db0e-11ef-878a-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"囏，古艱字。","note_content_jianti_auto":"囏，古艰字。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"90c06a0e-db0e-11ef-b7d0-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"治，直吏翻；下同。","note_content_jianti_auto":"治，直吏翻；下同。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":29,"tongjian_id":"90c06a0f-db0e-11ef-9fa9-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"應劭","people_name_jianti_auto":"应劭","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"90c06a11-db0e-11ef-bcc9-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"應劭曰：敷，陳也。各自奏陳其言，然後試之以官，考其功德也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"应劭曰：敷，陈也。各自奏陈其言，然后试之以官，考其功德也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":56,"tongjian_id":"90c06a10-db0e-11ef-aa35-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"90c06a13-db0e-11ef-9ae0-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"貢父","people_name_jianti_auto":"贡父","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"90c06a14-db0e-11ef-b158-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"師古曰：言各久其職事也。貢父曰：至于子孫，謂賞賜逮及子孫也，非謂侍中、尚書官至子孫不改易也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"师古曰：言各久其职事也。贡父曰：至于子孙，谓赏赐逮及子孙也，非谓侍中、尚书官至子孙不改易也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":85,"tongjian_id":"90c06a12-db0e-11ef-85c3-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Childr